WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.320
Cake or fake?

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:04.439
Headset cake. Bro, this one
looks more like it, dude.

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.800
What?
But this one has the LED on.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.340
But so does the other one.
It's on. Huh?

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.800
No, the alien!
I cut the alien!

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:12.920
Sorry, Alienware!

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:15.760
I'm not eating it, I'm on a diet.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:18.200
Mouse cake. Girl, I think
that one's the cake.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:20.200
Me too, this one's lit up, this one's off.

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:21.240
Feel the texture?

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:24.299
Press hard, press hard, go
on, squeeze it like this.

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:27.720
Cut it, go, go.
Whoa.

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:30.040
What kind of cake is this?
Looks like crude oil, man.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:31.879
What color is that?
No, go, go, go.

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.500
Mmm. Is it good, is it good?

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:37.640
Alienware. Keyboard cake.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:39.360
Holy shit, this one's tough, bro.

00:00:39.519 --> 00:00:41.580
Only one is cake, and
there are two keyboards.

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:44.280
Bite it.

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:50.560
Sorry, Alienware, for
eating the whole keyboard.

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:53.280
It's real cake, not just fondant.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:56.380
Happy 1st birthday to our
Alienware Training Facility Brazil!

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:00.400
Holy shit, what a huge bite!
Alienware.
